@startuml
title UML时序图 - 预订下单交互
actor 顾客 as C
participant 订单服务 as OS
participant 库存服务 as IS
participant 并发锁 as L
participant 超时调度 as TS
participant 支付服务 as PS
database 数据库 as DB

C -> OS: 提交预订(房型, 入住/离店日期)
activate OS
OS -> IS: 校验跨日库存
activate IS
IS -> DB: 查询每日库存
activate DB
DB --> IS: 返回每日库存数据
deactivate DB
IS -> L: 获取并发锁
activate L
L --> IS: 加锁成功
deactivate L
IS -> DB: 锁定并扣减库存
activate DB
DB --> IS: 扣减成功
deactivate DB
IS --> OS: 库存锁定成功
deactivate IS
OS -> DB: 生成待支付订单
activate DB
DB --> OS: 订单已保存
deactivate DB
OS -> TS: 启动15分钟超时任务
activate TS
TS --> OS: 已调度
deactivate TS
OS --> C: 返回待支付订单
deactivate OS

C -> PS: 发起支付
activate PS
PS -> DB: 更新订单为已确认
activate DB
DB --> PS: 更新成功
deactivate DB
PS --> C: 支付成功
deactivate PS
@enduml
